From 05a349e084aec79ba737d1e11a7157b977e2b81f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yeseul You <easter3538@naver.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 03:43:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Info-first hero, outcome numbers, compact modals, nav and
 layout fixes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Hero: eyebrow (name, 4 years in ops planning, companies), title and three
  outcome cards fit the first screen at 1440 and 390; thread becomes a
  one-time background animation that settles into a line linking the cards
- Nav: logo always visible; add Side project; order Projects > Side > Tools > Credentials
  (side section moved after projects to match)
- Main project cards: large result figure on the left
- Modal: AS-IS > change > TO-BE strip, problem/goal side by side, roles as chips
- Tools in two columns; contact cards never break mid-word
- P03 title shortened to 영업 리드 자동 분류·성과 리포트
- Strip C2PA metadata from diagrams (-54KB in index.html); remove stray 'Claude outputs' image
